        <mxCell id="cron-list" value="SCHEDULED:&#xa;• delays:check (15min) — stall/stop/GPS/ETA detection + escalation + resolution&#xa;• weather:check (30min) — weather per waypoint (depot+farms+destination)&#xa;• deliveries:auto-complete (hourly) — awaiting_confirmation >48h→completed&#xa;• deliveries:auto-complete-stale (hourly) — in_progress >48h stale→completed&#xa;• invoices:generate (hourly) — completed jobs→PDF invoice→email&#xa;• proposals:auto-reject-expired (hourly) — pending >48h→cancelled; free truck&#xa;• negotiations:auto-close-stale (daily) — OPEN/AGREED >48h inactive→CANCELLED&#xa;• data:cleanup (daily) — purge old tracking/notifications/weather&#xa;&#xa;MANUAL:&#xa;• crops:scrape — scrape DA prices for baseline_price_per_kg&#xa;• websocket:serve — start custom WebSocket server on port 8080&#xa;• app:backfill-buyer-profiles — one-off migration fix" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
